{"title": "Components/Switch/Switch Icon", "docs": {"text": "SwitchIcon\nWeb\nAndroid\niOS\nFlutter\nCMP\n\u26a0\ufe0f SwitchIcon Component Update\n\nThe SwitchIcon component has been upgraded to follow the latest ODS design and API standards. The previous API is now deprecated and will be removed in an upcoming release. To ensure compatibility and benefit from new features, please migrate your usage to the new API.\n\nA detailed migration guide is available here. You can also run the automated migration script to update your codebase:\n\nnpx --package @telekom-ods/migration@latest migrate-switch src/your-project-folder\n\n\nShow code\nCopy code\nODSSwitchIcon extends the native HTMLDivElement properties as React props. On top of the additional properties that are listed below, you can also pass the native HTMLDivElement properties as React props. You can read more about those properties here.\n\n\nName\tDescription\tDefault\tControl\nsize\t\n\"small\"\n\"large\"\n\"large\"\nsize\n\nsmall\n\nlarge\nselected\t\nboolean\n-\tSet boolean\ndefaultSelected\t\nSpecifies the initial selected state of the Component.\nboolean\nfalse\nFalseTrue\ndisabled\t\nboolean\nfalse\nFalseTrue\nreadonly\t\nboolean\nfalse\nFalseTrue\nloading\t\nboolean\nfalse\nFalseTrue\ndisableFocusVisible\t\nWhen true it removes the focus styling of the component and leaves it up to the dev to implement focus\nboolean\nfalse\nFalseTrue\ninputProps\t\nAll allowed input field props\nODSComponentPropsWithRef<\"input\">\n-\t\n\ninputProps :{\nname : \"switch\"\nid : \"switch\"\naria-label : \"Switch\"\n}\ncheckmarkIcon\t\nIcon to be displayed when switch is selected. If nothing is set the default checkmark Icon will be set.\nReactNode\n\n<ODSCheckmark />\nSet object\nParent Class Behavior\n\nThe .ODSSwitchIcon-Parent class is included in the ODS SDK and can be applied to any parent container (for example, a Card component) that wraps the switch.\n\nPurpose\n\nIt ensures that hover and active states on the parent container are also reflected on the switch itself.\nThis provides a consistent interaction pattern when the switch is part of a larger interactive area (e.g., selecting an entire card instead of just the switch).\nHow It Works\n\nWhen the parent container with .ODSSwitchIcon-Parent is hovered, the switch inside it will also display its hover styles.\nWhen the parent container is pressed (active state), the switch shows its active state styling as well.\nInteraction with disableFocusVisible\n\nBy default, the switch manages its own focus-visible styles.\nIf you pass disableFocusVisible={true}, the switch will not render its built-in focus styling.\nThis allows the parent container (e.g., a Card) to take full control of focus handling while still leveraging the hover/active propagation from .ODSSwitchIcon-Parent.\nExample\n\n<div className=\"ODSSwitchIcon-Parent\">\n  <ODSSwitchIcon />\n</div>\nCopy\nIn this example, hovering or pressing anywhere on the div triggers hover/active styles on the ODSSwitchIcon, creating a seamless and accessible interaction pattern.\n\nUsage Examples\n\nForm\n\nForm with Switches\nSubmitted form data: false,true, false\n\n\n\n\nSubmit\nShow code\nCopy code\nParent Class Usage\n\nThis is to demonstrate the usage of the parent class\n\nUsing class name ODSSwitchIcon-Parent on a div that contains an ODSSwitchIcon will also trigger its hover/active state\n\n\nShow code\nCopy code\n", "code": ["", "<div className=\"ODSSwitchIcon-Parent\">\n  <ODSSwitchIcon />\n</div>\nCopy\n", "<div className=\"ODSSwitchIcon-Parent\">\n  <ODSSwitchIcon />\n</div>\n"], "stories": [{"id": "story--components-switchicon--example", "html": "<div id=\"story--components-switchicon--example-inner\" data-name=\"Example\" lang=\"en\"><div><div style=\"height: 200px; display: flex; width: 300px; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><div class=\"ODSColumn ODSSwitchIcon ODSSwitchIcon--size-large\"><input role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\" aria-readonly=\"false\" aria-busy=\"false\" tabindex=\"0\" id=\"switch\" aria-label=\"Switch\" class=\"sr-only ODSSwitchIcon-Input\" type=\"checkbox\" name=\"switch\"><div class=\"ODSColumn ODSSwitchIcon-Stroke ODSSwitchIcon-Stroke--size-large\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"ODSColumn ODSSwitchIcon-Container ODSSwitchIcon-Container--size-large\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"ODSRow ODSSwitchIcon-Handle ODSSwitchIcon-Handle--size-large\"></div></div></div></div></div></div>"}, {"id": "story--components-switchicon--form", "html": "<div id=\"story--components-switchicon--form-inner\" data-name=\"Form\" lang=\"en\"><div><div style=\"height: 200px; display: flex; width: 300px; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><form style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid black; border-radius: 8px;\"><h3 style=\"margin: 0px;\">Form with Switches</h3><h4 style=\"width: 250px; margin: 0px;\">Submitted form data: false,true, false</h4><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 8px 0px;\"><div class=\"ODSColumn ODSSwitchIcon ODSSwitchIcon--size-small\"><input role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\" aria-readonly=\"false\" aria-busy=\"false\" tabindex=\"0\" id=\"switch1\" aria-label=\"Switch 1\" class=\"sr-only ODSSwitchIcon-Input\" type=\"checkbox\" name=\"switch1\"><div class=\"ODSColumn ODSSwitchIcon-Stroke ODSSwitchIcon-Stroke--size-small\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"ODSColumn ODSSwitchIcon-Container ODSSwitchIcon-Container--size-small\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"ODSRow ODSSwitchIcon-Handle ODSSwitchIcon-Handle--size-small\"></div></div></div><div class=\"ODSColumn ODSSwitchIcon ODSSwitchIcon--size-small ODSSwitchIcon--selected\"><input role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\" aria-readonly=\"false\" aria-busy=\"false\" tabindex=\"0\" id=\"switch2\" aria-label=\"Switch 2\" class=\"sr-only ODSSwitchIcon-Input\" type=\"checkbox\" che